                ":question/worked-solution": "The solution of the system corresponds to the point of intersection of the lines. \n\n![](images/5c/5c1c69adc880ea7cfdb5a4e0a10abd6032d2eedf0386923b94df9b7c173edd6d.png)\n\nIn this case, we have the point $(4,2).$ Therefore, the solution to the given system is $(4,2).$"
